  "description": "Dillon Marshall is thrilled to present Eglinton Place ,a prestigious collection of 1, 2, and 3-bedroom rental apartments nestled in the heart of Donnybrook, Dublin 4. This unique development offers a rare opportunity to experience serene urban living in a picturesque, leafy suburb, just steps away from the vibrant social hotspots and hubs of Ballsbridge, The Docklands, and Dublin City Centre. Residents at Eglinton Place will enjoy outstanding panoramic views of Dublin city, the coast and the Dublin Mountains from the apartments and rooftop terraces. This is a rare opportunity to lease in a prime city living within a serene, landmark development. With 148 high-quality apartments, each designed for comfort and style, Eglinton Place redefines urban living. Immerse yourself in the local culture with cafes, restaurants, parks like Herbert Park, and the scenic Dodder River Greenway just around the corner.",
